/*
 * $DOC$
 * $NAME$
 * GTI_MINIMIZED
 *
 * $ONELINER$
 * Query or change whether the window is minimized
 *
 * $SYNTAX$
 * GtInfo( GTI_MINIMIZED, [lMinimized] ) --> lMinimized
 *
 * $ARGUMENTS$
 * `GTI_MINIMIZED` The selector, from gtinfo.ch.
 * `lMinimized` .T. minimizes the window, .F. restores it.
 *
 * $RETURNS$
 * The state before the call.
 *
 * $DESCRIPTION$
 * A minimized window is shown only in the task bar.
 *
 * $NOTES$
 * Supported by GTWVT, GTSDL3, GTXWC and GTGLFW. On other terminals the result is NIL.
 *
 * $EXAMPLES$
 *
 * $OUTPUT$
 *
 * $CATEGORY$
 * Functions GT
 *
 * $HEADER$
 * gtinfo.ch
 *
 * $SEEALSO$
 * GTI_MAXIMIZED
 *
 * $DOCEND$
 */
